Bind Npc 24202 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14202 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 787 "[Crack of All Means] Mend the barn before the horse is stolen."
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Collect 5 of 900324000
    Collect 1 of 900325000

Requires player level >= 53 and quest 786 is completed

Rewards
    Give 12500000 experience
    Give 1 of 900326000

On available
    Say "Let's hurry and go."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I've read the report. It seems it's a big deal. It's better to always prevent things than fixing after bad things happen."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please collect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place I send you. You can get them from [Anceitn Trent] and [Legendary Old Tree].\n\nCollect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place [Secret Deputy] Clarence from Belua Town sends you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I've read the report. It seems it's a big deal. It's better to always prevent things than fixing after bad things happen."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please collect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place I send you. You can get them from [Anceitn Trent] and [Legendary Old Tree].\n\nCollect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place [Secret Deputy] Clarence from Asga Town sends you."

On in_progress
    Say "You don't have enough yet. Do I have to send you again? So annoying..."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You have them all! Good!\n\nBring this fruit juice to Herga. Herga will make a good use out of this."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You have them all! Good!\n\nBring this fruit juice to Nez. Nez will make a good use out of this."

On completed
    Say "Come back when you are level 54."
